  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>[</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>We have&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Hence, the region bounded by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is given by the following graph.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0100_b6ed28bbaebb.png\" style=\"width: 397px; height: 350px;\" /></p><p>Hence, the area bounded by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>27</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>41</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;sq units.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>41</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
